{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Now I understand the workspace package. The task says:\n\n4. **dream 的 4 个扫描函数**（`selectPendingJobs`/`getDreamProcessedJobs`/`discoverCompletedJobs`/`jobNumber`）迁 workspace（本 task 迁编排，tasks.json 极薄读取器类型定义在 task8 落地）\n\nSo I need to migrate these 4 scan functions to workspace. But `discoverCompletedJobs` depends on `executor.LoadTasksJSON` + `TasksJSON.GetAllTasks()` + `TaskState.Status`. The task says \"tasks.json 极薄读取器类型定义在 task8 落地\" — meaning the minimal tasks.json reader type will be defined in task8, but in THIS task I still migrate the orchestration.\n\nWait, let me re-read the task description carefully:\n\n> ### dream（唯一 executor 依赖 = LoadTasksJSON，line 169）\n> - cli 保留 `NewDreamCmd`（`-p/--background`、`--job_num int`(默认5)）；迁出 `dreamWorkflow`→`handler.Dream`、`runDreamDryRun`→`handler.DreamDryRun`、`selectPendingJobs`/`getDreamProcessedJobs`/`discoverCompletedJobs`/`jobNumber`（4 个确定性扫描过滤函数）\n> - **扫描过滤留在 Go（确定性输入过滤，决定哪些 job 要 dream）**：`discoverCompletedJobs` 依赖的 `executor.LoadTasksJSON` + `TasksJSON.GetAllTasks()` + `TaskState.Status` 迁 `workspace`（极薄读取器，task8 显式落地）\n\nSo the scan functions migrate to workspace. And `discoverCompletedJobs` depends on `executor.LoadTasksJSON` etc., which will migrate to `workspace` (thin reader) but \"task8 显式落地\" — meaning the actual type definition lands in task8.\n\nHmm, this is a bit confusing. Let me re-read:\n\n> **dream 的 4 个扫描函数**（`selectPendingJobs`/`getDreamProcessedJobs`/`discoverCompletedJobs`/`jobNumber`）迁 workspace（本 task 迁编排，tasks.json 极薄读取器类型定义在 task8 落地）\n\nSo in this task, I migrate the 4 scan functions to workspace. The `discoverCompletedJobs` needs a tasks.json reader. The task says the \"极薄读取器类型定义在 task8 落地\" (the thin reader type definition lands in task8).\n\nWait, but that's contradictory. If `discoverCompletedJobs` needs `LoadTasksJSON`/`TasksJSON`/`TaskState`, and those are migrated to workspace in task8, then how does `discoverCompletedJobs` work in task7?\n\nLet me re-read more carefully. Actually I think the resolution is:\n- In THIS task (task7), I migrate the 4 scan functions to `workspace` package, but they still use `executor.LoadTasksJSON` (since executor is still alive until task8). The \"极薄读取器类型定义在 task8 落地\" means that in task8, `executor.LoadTasksJSON` will be moved into `workspace` (or a thin reader will be defined there).\n\nActually, looking at the \"关键结果\" section:\n\n> 4. **dream 的 4 个扫描函数**（`selectPendingJobs`/`getDreamProcessedJobs`/`discoverCompletedJobs`/`jobNumber`）迁 workspace（本 task 迁编排，tasks.json 极薄读取器类型定义在 task8 落地）\n\nAnd the dream detail:\n> **扫描过滤留在 Go（确定性输入过滤，决定哪些 job 要 dream）**：`discoverCompletedJobs` 依赖的 `executor.LoadTasksJSON` + `TasksJSON.GetAllTasks()` + `TaskState.Status` 迁 `workspace`（极薄读取器，task8 显式落地）\n\nHmm wait, actually reading again: \"discoverCompletedJobs 依赖的 executor.LoadTasksJSON + TasksJSON.GetAllTasks() + TaskState.Status 迁 workspace（极薄读取器，task8 显式落地）\". \n\nI think the meaning is: the scan functions migrate to workspace in this task. The thin reader (LoadTasksJSON etc.) that `discoverCompletedJobs` depends on will migrate to workspace explicitly in task8. So in this task, `workspace` can still import `executor` for `LoadTasksJSON`.\n\nActually wait — but that creates a dependency direction issue. Let me think about the layering:\n- workspace is L4 (infrastructure)\n- executor is being deleted (task8)\n- handler is L2\n\nIn task7, the dream scan functions move to workspace. But they depend on executor.LoadTasksJSON. Since executor will be deleted in task8, and the thin reader \"task8 显式落地\", it means:\n- In task7: workspace imports executor (temporarily), OR the scan functions stay in a place that imports executor.\n- In task8: executor's thin reader moves to workspace, and workspace stops importing executor.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. Maybe the cleaner interpretation: In task7, I migrate the 4 scan functions into